      "body": "DAPS Advertising Limited announced that Ms. Mansi Bajpai (ACS 52313) has resigned from the position of Whole Time Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from January 19, 2026 due to personal reasons. The company has accepted the resignation and the same will be placed in the immediate next board meeting for taking note of. Ms. Bajpai confirmed that there are no other material reasons for her resignation other than those stated above. She further confirmed that she has duly completed the handover of her responsibilities and records to the satisfaction of the management.",
